                <mxCell id="56" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scaling Strategy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Distribute load across K GCP projects&lt;br&gt;• Each project: independent quotas&lt;br&gt;• Rate limits per project:&lt;br&gt;   — tokens/sec limit&lt;br&gt;   — tokens/min limit&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Run Quota Router selects project&lt;br&gt;  per request (stateless round-robin)&lt;br&gt;• Direct SDK calls — no middleware&lt;br&gt;• All traffic stays within GCP backbone&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Optional: multi-region routing&lt;br&gt;for higher throughput &amp;amp; resilience&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F8E9;strokeColor=#689F38;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1030" y="690" width="410" height="280" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="57" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why Multiple Projects?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;GCP API quotas (including Vertex AI)&lt;br&gt;are enforced &lt;b&gt;per project&lt;/b&gt;, not per org.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Using K projects multiplies the&lt;br&gt;total available quota by K.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Cloud Run Quota Router distributes&lt;br&gt;requests evenly across all projects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Single-Cloud Advantage:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No cross-cloud VPN needed.&lt;br&gt;All calls stay on GCP backbone.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F8E9;strokeColor=#689F38;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1490" y="690" width="410" height="280" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="58" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;GCP Project Structure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;project-translation&lt;/b&gt; (1 project):&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Run, Internal ALB, VPC&lt;br&gt;• Secret Manager, Cloud Firestore&lt;br&gt;• Artifact Registry&lt;br&gt;• Cloud Operations (Logging/Monitoring)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;project-llm-1..K&lt;/b&gt; (K projects):&lt;br&gt;• Vertex AI + Gemini 2.5 Flash&lt;br&gt;• Independent quota per project&lt;br&gt;• Service accounts for each&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Total:&lt;/b&gt; K+1 GCP projects&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F8E9;strokeColor=#689F38;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1950" y="690" width="410" height="280" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="90" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #666;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;  Async HTTPS  •  Batch Translation &amp;amp; Evaluation  •  LLM-as-Judge Quality Scoring (faithfulness, fluency, glossary compliance)  •  Cloud Firestore Glossary (kind-specific, cached)  •  Multi-Project Quota Distribution  •  Language Detection (Unicode script + langdetect)  •  Serverless (Cloud Run)  •  Direct SDK Calls  •  GCP VPC + Private Google Access  •  Secret Manager  •  Cloud Operations (Logging + Monitoring + Alerting + Trace)  •  Firewall Rules  •  TLS 1.3 Encrypted  •  HA VPN (IPsec)  •  Single Cloud (GCP-Only)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=4;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="29" y="1691" width="2530" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
